 "remarks": "Built in 2019 and ideally located close to town, this exceptional 3-bedroom, 2.1-bath townhouse offers a bright, open floor plan with 9 ft ceilings and sophisticated finishes throughout. A dramatic two-story foyer welcomes you into the home, featuring hardwood floors, a gourmet kitchen with marble countertops, a formal dining room, and a family room with a fireplace conveniently located adjacent to the kitchen. The spacious, sun-filled living room provides the perfect setting for both everyday living and entertaining. The primary suite features a walk-in closet and an elegant marble bath. Step outside to a private stone terrace, ideal for outdoor dining, entertaining guests, or simply relaxing. Additional highlights include a heated two-car attached garage and a finished lower level",
